OL,3,GNEWSAThe accordion player who has been
OL,4,Abusking in hospital for 35 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor 35 years, volunteer John Jones has
OL,7,Fbeen entertaining patients and visitors
OL,8,Fat Macclesfield District General
OL,9,FHospital by playing the accordion.
OL,11,FThe 84-year-old retired engineer
OL,12,Fdiscovered his love of the accordion as
OL,13,Fa child, watching his father play the
OL,14,Finstrument.
OL,16,F"My dad played the accordion all the
OL,17,Ftime and I could play the piano a
OL,18,Flittle bit," he said.
OL,20,F"When he died, I started messing around
OL,21,Fwith his accordion.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
